# ==============================================================================
# Strict Public Repository Allowlist for eddiealexander77/aw1000-control
# Blocks all personal router logs, SSH credentials, keystores, and local backups
# ==============================================================================
/*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!.github/
!.github/**
!aw1000-web/
!aw1000-web/**
!aw1000-pwa/
!aw1000-pwa/**
!aw1000-apk/
!aw1000-apk/**
!aw1000-release/
!aw1000-release/**
!router/
!router/aw1000-telemetry
!router/aw1000-ctl

# Always ignore build artifacts, signing secrets, dependencies, and personal scripts
node_modules/
*.jks
*.keystore
local.properties
.gradle/
app/build/
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.apk
*.ipk
*.log
*.bak
aw1000-pwa/certs/
aw1000-pwa/scripts/push-to-router.sh
aw1000-pwa/DEPLOY.md
aw1000-pwa/dist/
aw1000-pwa/design-mock.html
aw1000-release/SHA256SUMS.txt
